Package: vabaxos-welcome
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, espeak-ng, alsa-utils, kmod, console-setup, init-system-helpers
Description: Welcome to VabaxOS, spoken, before the desktop
 A text menu on the first console that speaks with eSpeak NG (ADR-0016):
 language, then try VabaxOS, voice and keyboard, restart or shut down.
 It works without the graphical desktop.
